{"name":"Jumbo","hex":"#878785","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Jumbo","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A nickname for one or that of a large size","A nickname for one or that of a small size"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Jumbo"}],"entries":[{"title":"Jumbo","blocks":[{"text":"Jumbo, also known as Jumbo the Elephant and Jumbo the Circus Elephant, was a 19th-century male African bush elephant born in Sudan. Jumbo was exported to Jardin des Plantes, a zoo in Paris, and then transferred in 1865 to London Zoo in England. Despite public protest, Jumbo was sold to P. T. Barnum, who took him to the United States for exhibition in March 1882."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Jumbo_poster_1.jpg/330px-Jumbo_poster_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jumbo","wikidata":"Q831999"},{"title":"Jumbo (2008 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Jumbo is a 2008 Indian animated adventure film directed by Kompin Kemgumnird, produced by Percept Picture Company and features the voices of Akshay Kumar, Lara Dutta, Dimple Kapadia, Rajpal Yadav, Asrani, and Gulshan Grover. Jayveer Singh, aka Jumbo, is a little elephant who tries to find his father, and the journey of finding his father made him a war elephant. The film is a Hindi remake and Hindi dubbed version of the 2006 Thai film Khan Kluay, which is based on \"Chao Praya Prab Hongsawadee\" by Ariya Jintapanichkarn."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/7c/Jumbo_hindi.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jumbo_(2008_film)","wikidata":"Q6310862"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Jumbo_and_Matthew_Scott_giving_a_ride_to_children_about_the_Zoo.png/500px-Jumbo_and_Matthew_Scott_giving_a_ride_to_children_about_the_Zoo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Jumbo_and_Matthew_Scott_giving_a_ride_to_children_about_the_Zoo.png/500px-Jumbo_and_Matthew_Scott_giving_a_ride_to_children_about_the_Zoo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Jumbo and Matthew Scott giving a ride to children in London Zoo","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJumbo_and_Matthew_Scott_giving_a_ride_to_children_about_the_Zoo.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Jumbo_refuses_to_leave_London_Zoo.png/500px-Jumbo_refuses_to_leave_London_Zoo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Jumbo_refuses_to_leave_London_Zoo.png/500px-Jumbo_refuses_to_leave_London_Zoo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\"Jumbo's pitiful refusal to leave London Zoo tugged at the nation's heartstrings\"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJumbo_refuses_to_leave_London_Zoo.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Jumbo%27s_Journey_to_the_Docks.jpg/500px-Jumbo%27s_Journey_to_the_Docks.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Jumbo%27s_Journey_to_the_Docks.jpg/1280px-Jumbo%27s_Journey_to_the_Docks.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Jumbo%27s_Journey_to_the_Docks.jpg/500px-Jumbo%27s_Journey_to_the_Docks.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Jumbo's Journey to the Docks, The Illustrated London News, April 1, 1882","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJumbo's_Journey_to_the_Docks.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb